{"seq":3,"slug":"signing-and-provenance","title":"镜像签名与构建溯源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/supply-chain/signing-and-provenance","wordCount":1075,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"镜像签名与构建溯源\">镜像签名与构建溯源</h1><p>扫描确认镜像无已知漏洞，SBOM 记录了完整的组件清单——但如何证明这个镜像确实是由你信任的 CI/CD 流水线从你审查过的源码构建出来的？在 SolarWinds 事件中，攻击者篡改了构建过程本身，产出的二进制文件虽然通过了常规安全检查，却包含后门。镜像签名（Sigstore/Cosign）和构建溯源（SLSA）就是为了解决这个&quot;最后一公里信任&quot;问题——建立从源码提交到运行容器的密码学可验证链条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>镜像签名和构建溯源共同构成容器供应链的信任锚：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[源码提交] --&gt; B[CI 触发构建]&#10;    B --&gt; C[隔离构建环境]&#10;    C --&gt; D[产出镜像 + SBOM]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Cosign 签名镜像摘要]&#10;    E --&gt; F[in-toto 生成 Provenance]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Rekor 记录透明日志]&#10;    G --&gt; H[推送至 OCI Registry]&#10;    H --&gt; I[部署前准入验证]&#10;    I --&gt; J{签名 + Provenance 有效?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| K[允许部署]&#10;    J --&gt;|否| L[拒绝部署]\">graph LR\n    A[源码提交] --&gt; B[CI 触发构建]\n    B --&gt; C[隔离构建环境]\n    C --&gt; D[产出镜像 + SBOM]\n    D --&gt; E[Cosign 签名镜像摘要]\n    E --&gt; F[in-toto 生成 Provenance]\n    F --&gt; G[Rekor 记录透明日志]\n    G --&gt; H[推送至 OCI Registry]\n    H --&gt; I[部署前准入验证]\n    I --&gt; J{签名 + Provenance 有效?}\n    J --&gt;|是| K[允许部署]\n    J --&gt;|否| L[拒绝部署]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>标准/规范</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cosign</td>\n<td>镜像签名/验证</td>\n<td>镜像完整性、来源身份</td>\n<td>Sigstore 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fulcio</td>\n<td>短期证书签发（基于 OIDC）</td>\n<td>消除长期密钥管理</td>\n<td>Sigstore CA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rekor</td>\n<td>透明日志（不可变）</td>\n<td>签名公开可审计</td>\n<td>RFC 6962 类似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLSA</td>\n<td>构建安全等级框架</td>\n<td>构建过程完整性</td>\n<td>SLSA v1.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>in-toto</td>\n<td>构建步骤证明格式</td>\n<td>记录谁在何环境用何参数构建</td>\n<td>in-toto spec</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sigstore-与-keyless-签名\">Sigstore 与 Keyless 签名</h2><p>传统的镜像签名（GPG/PEM 密钥对）面临一个根本性的运维难题：谁来安全地管理签名密钥？密钥泄露意味着攻击者可以签署恶意镜像；密钥轮换需要更新所有验证方的信任配置。</p>\n<p>Sigstore 通过 <strong>keyless signing</strong>（无密钥签名）模式优雅地解决了这个问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>CI/CD 系统（如 GitHub Actions）通过 OIDC 协议证明自己的身份</li>\n<li>Fulcio 验证 OIDC token 后签发一个极短生命周期（10 分钟）的证书</li>\n<li>Cosign 使用该证书对镜像摘要进行签名</li>\n<li>签名连同证书被记录到 Rekor 透明日志中</li>\n<li>证书过期，但签名在 Rekor 中的时间戳证明了签名时刻证书有效</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CI/CD 中的 keyless 签名（GitHub Actions 环境自动提供 OIDC）&#10;cosign sign --yes ghcr.io/myorg/myapp@sha256:abc123def456...&#10;&#10;# 验证签名（指定预期的签名者身份）&#10;cosign verify \\&#10;  --certificate-identity &quot;https://github.com/myorg/myapp/.github/workflows/build.yml@refs/heads/main&quot; \\&#10;  --certificate-oidc-issuer &quot;https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com&quot; \\&#10;  ghcr.io/myorg/myapp@sha256:abc123def456...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI/CD 中的 keyless 签名（GitHub Actions 环境自动提供 OIDC）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cosign</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --yes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghcr.io/myorg/myapp@sha256:abc123def456...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证签名（指定预期的签名者身份）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cosign</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> verify</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --certificate-identity</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://github.com/myorg/myapp/.github/workflows/build.yml@refs/heads/main\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --certificate-oidc-issuer</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  ghcr.io/myorg/myapp@sha256:abc123def456...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键细节：<strong>始终基于镜像 digest（sha256:...）而非 tag 进行签名和验证</strong>。Tag 是可变的——<code>v1.2.3</code> 今天指向一个镜像，明天可能被重新指向另一个。Digest 是内容寻址的，不可变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"slsa-构建溯源等级\">SLSA 构建溯源等级</h2><p>SLSA（Supply-chain Levels for Software Artifacts，发音 &quot;salsa&quot;）定义了构建过程安全性的递进等级：</p>\n<p><strong>Level 1</strong>：构建过程有文档化的 provenance（记录源码和构建方式），但不要求防篡改。最低门槛，适合作为起步。</p>\n<p><strong>Level 2</strong>：构建在托管服务（如 GitHub Actions）上执行，provenance 由构建服务而非开发者生成，具有一定的抗篡改能力。</p>\n<p><strong>Level 3</strong>（2026 年推荐的生产基线）：构建在隔离环境中执行（无网络访问、临时环境、不可变），provenance 不可伪造——即使构建脚本被修改，也无法产出虚假的溯源记录。</p>\n<p>实现 SLSA Level 3 的 GitHub Actions 配置使用 <code>slsa-github-generator</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  build:&#10;    # ... 构建步骤 ...&#10;  provenance:&#10;    needs: build&#10;    uses: slsa-framework/slsa-github-generator/.github/workflows/generator_container_slsa3.yml@v2.0.0&#10;    with:&#10;      image: ghcr.io/myorg/myapp&#10;      digest: ${{ needs.build.outputs.digest }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # ... 构建步骤 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  provenance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slsa-framework/slsa-github-generator/.github/workflows/generator_container_slsa3.yml@v2.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ghcr.io/myorg/myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      digest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ needs.build.outputs.digest }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"attestation-附加与存储\">Attestation 附加与存储</h2><p>签名和 provenance 作为 <strong>attestation</strong> 附加到 OCI 镜像制品上。OCI 标准（通过 Referrers API）支持将任意元数据关联到镜像 digest：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>签名 attestation</strong>：证明&quot;谁签署了这个镜像&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>SBOM attestation</strong>：证明&quot;这个镜像包含哪些组件&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Provenance attestation</strong>：证明&quot;这个镜像由什么源码通过什么流程构建&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>VEX attestation</strong>：证明&quot;已知漏洞在此镜像中的实际影响状态&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 将 SBOM 作为 attestation 附加到镜像&#10;cosign attest --yes \\&#10;  --type cyclonedx \\&#10;  --predicate sbom.json \\&#10;  ghcr.io/myorg/myapp@sha256:abc123...&#10;&#10;# 验证 attestation&#10;cosign verify-attestation \\&#10;  --type cyclonedx \\&#10;  --certificate-identity &quot;...&quot; \\&#10;  --certificate-oidc-issuer &quot;...&quot; \\&#10;  ghcr.io/myorg/myapp@sha256:abc123...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 将 SBOM 作为 attestation 附加到镜像</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cosign</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> attest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --yes</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cyclonedx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --predicate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sbom.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  ghcr.io/myorg/myapp@sha256:abc123...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证 attestation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cosign</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> verify-attestation</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cyclonedx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --certificate-identity</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --certificate-oidc-issuer</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  ghcr.io/myorg/myapp@sha256:abc123...</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"部署时验证闭环\">部署时验证闭环</h2><p>签名和溯源的价值只有在部署时被强制验证才能完全实现。Kyverno 原生支持 Cosign 签名验证作为准入策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kyverno.io/v1&#10;kind: ClusterPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: verify-image-signature&#10;spec:&#10;  validationFailureAction: Enforce&#10;  rules:&#10;    - name: check-signature&#10;      match:&#10;        any:&#10;          - resources:&#10;              kinds: [&#39;Pod&#39;]&#10;      verifyImages:&#10;        - imageReferences: [&#39;ghcr.io/myorg/*&#39;]&#10;          attestors:&#10;            - entries:&#10;                - keyless:&#10;                    subject: &#39;https://github.com/myorg/*&#39;&#10;                    issuer: &#39;https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kyverno.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">verify-image-signature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  validationFailureAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Enforce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">check-signature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Pod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      verifyImages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">imageReferences</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ghcr.io/myorg/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          attestors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">entries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">keyless</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://github.com/myorg/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    issuer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这形成了一个完整的闭环：只有经过受信任的 CI 流水线构建、经过签名、附带有效 provenance 的镜像才能进入生产集群。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Sigstore keyless 签名消除了密钥管理难题，CI/CD 身份即签名身份</li>\n<li>始终基于镜像 digest 而非 tag 签名——tag 可变，digest 不可变</li>\n<li>SLSA Level 3 是 2026 年生产环境的推荐基线：隔离构建 + 不可伪造的 provenance</li>\n<li>Attestation（签名 + SBOM + Provenance + VEX）作为 OCI 元数据附加到镜像</li>\n<li>部署时通过 Kyverno/Gatekeeper 强制验证，形成&quot;不可信则不部署&quot;的闭环</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"image-scanning-trivy\">镜像漏洞扫描与 Trivy</a>——签名之前首先确保镜像无已知高危漏洞</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/artifact-integrity-and-provenance/artifact-signing-sigstore\">制品签名与 Sigstore</a>——Sigstore 生态的深入技术解析</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"镜像签名与构建溯源","id":"镜像签名与构建溯源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Sigstore 与 Keyless 签名","id":"sigstore-与-keyless-签名"},{"level":2,"text":"SLSA 构建溯源等级","id":"slsa-构建溯源等级"},{"level":2,"text":"Attestation 附加与存储","id":"attestation-附加与存储"},{"level":2,"text":"部署时验证闭环","id":"部署时验证闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"SBOM 与 VEX 漏洞消解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/supply-chain/sbom-and-vex"},"next":{"title":"Falco 运行时威胁检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/falco-runtime-detection"}}